sequenceDiagram
  participant Browser as "Browser (Utilizador)"
  participant SpringBoot as "Spring Boot (WebSocket)"
  participant ServicoStats as "Serviço de Atualização de Estatísticas"
  participant ServicoGateway as "Serviço Gateway (wrapper RMI)"
  participant Gateway as "Gateway (Meta 1)"

  Note over Gateway,ServicoStats: Fase de registo (arranque)
  ServicoStats->>ServicoGateway: registerStatsListener()
  ServicoGateway->>Gateway: regista listener RMI
  Gateway->>Gateway: adiciona a statsListeners

  Note over Browser,Gateway: Fluxo híbrido: Callback RMI + Push WebSocket

  rect rgb(200, 220, 255)
  Note over Gateway,ServicoStats: 1) O Gateway deteta uma alteração nas estatísticas
  Gateway->>Gateway: notifyStatsListeners()
  end

  rect rgb(255, 220, 200)
  Note over Gateway,ServicoStats: 2) Callback RMI direto sem polling
  Gateway->>ServicoStats: updateStats(SystemStats) RMI
  activate ServicoStats
  ServicoStats->>ServicoStats: guarda lastStats
  end

  rect rgb(200, 255, 220)
  Note over ServicoStats,SpringBoot: 3) Difusão via WebSocket broadcast
  ServicoStats->>SpringBoot: convertAndSend topic/stats stats
  deactivate ServicoStats
  activate SpringBoot
  SpringBoot->>SpringBoot: broker encaminha para subscritores
  end

  rect rgb(255, 255, 200)
  Note over SpringBoot,Browser: 4) Push em tempo real para o browser
  SpringBoot->>Browser: WebSocket mensagem topic /topic/stats
  deactivate SpringBoot
  activate Browser
  Browser->>Browser: updateStatsUI stats
  deactivate Browser
  end

  Note over Browser,Gateway: As estatísticas são atualizadas em tempo real sem refresh periódico
